{
  "name": "Excel → Gemini+Grok → Claude → Word (Docker · final)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Excel Upload",
        "formDescription": "Titles असलेली Excel फाईल अपलोड करा",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Excel File",
              "fieldType": "file",
              "requiredField": true,
              "acceptFileTypes": ".xlsx,.xls"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "respondWithOptions": {
            "values": {
              "respondWith": "text",
              "formSubmittedText": "फाईल मिळाली — काम सुरू झाले आहे. सर्व titles चे काम पूर्ण झाल्यावर output फोल्डरमधली Word फाईल आपोआप उघडेल. हा tab आता बंद करू शकता."
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "1",
      "name": "Upload Excel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -2400,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "excel-upload-form"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{$binary['Excel_File'].fileExtension}}",
              "rightValue": "xlsx",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2",
      "name": "Detect Excel File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -2160,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "अपलोड केलेली फाईल .xlsx नाही. कृपया योग्य Excel (.xlsx) फाईल अपलोड करा."
      },
      "id": "16",
      "name": "Invalid File Type",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2160,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:5959/doc/start",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ start: true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "21",
      "name": "Start Word Doc",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -2160,
        -180
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "workflow सुरू होताच एकदाच चालतो (इथे फक्त 1 item असतो) — output फोल्डरमध्ये नवी (रिकामी) Word फाईल तयार करतो, पण अजून उघडत नाही (सर्व titles संपल्यावरच उघडेल). हा एक side-branch आहे, मुख्य data flow ला अडथळा नाही."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "xlsx",
        "binaryPropertyName": "Excel_File",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3",
      "name": "Read Excel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1920,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "f1",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.Status}}",
              "rightValue": "PENDING",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4",
      "name": "Get PENDING Titles",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -1680,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5",
      "name": "Loop Over Titles",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -1440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:5959/chat/gemini",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ text: $('Loop Over Titles').item.json.Title }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "6",
      "name": "Gemini Existing Chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -1200,
        -120
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "BYPASS करायचे असल्यास: या नोडवर उजवे-क्लिक -> Deactivate. मग Claude ला फक्त Grok चे उत्तर जाईल."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:5959/chat/grok",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ text: $('Loop Over Titles').item.json.Title }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "8",
      "name": "Grok Existing Chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -1200,
        120
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "BYPASS करायचे असल्यास: या नोडवर उजवे-क्लिक -> Deactivate. मग Claude ला फक्त Gemini चे उत्तर जाईल."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "g1",
              "name": "geminiOutput",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.response ? $json.response : ($json.error ? ('(Gemini Error: ' + JSON.stringify($json.error) + ')') : '') }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "17",
      "name": "Rename Gemini Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -1000,
        -120
      ],
      "notes": "Gemini node Deactivate केला असेल तर इथे geminiOutput रिकामे राहते (bypass)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "gr1",
              "name": "grokOutput",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.response ? $json.response : ($json.error ? ('(Grok Error: ' + JSON.stringify($json.error) + ')') : '') }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "18",
      "name": "Rename Grok Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -1000,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combineBy": "combineByPosition",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "19",
      "name": "Merge Gemini & Grok",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -820,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Gemini आणि Grok चे उत्तर एकाच item मध्ये आणतो. एखादा नोड bypass असला तरी तो branch passthrough करतो, त्यामुळे position match बरोबर राहतो."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cp1",
              "name": "combinedText",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ ($json.geminiOutput ? ('Gemini उत्तर:\\n' + $json.geminiOutput + '\\n\\n') : '') + ($json.grokOutput ? ('Grok उत्तर:\\n' + $json.grokOutput) : '') }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20",
      "name": "Build Claude Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -640,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "जे उत्तर आले तेच एकत्र करतो — Gemini bypass असेल तर फक्त Grok, Grok bypass असेल तर फक्त Gemini."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:5959/chat/claude",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ text: $json.combinedText, title: $('Loop Over Titles').item.json.Title }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 600000
        }
      },
      "id": "10",
      "name": "Claude Existing Chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -440,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "BYPASS करायचे असल्यास: या नोडवर उजवे-क्लिक -> Deactivate. मग Gemini + Grok चे उत्तर थेट Word फाईलमध्ये लाल रंगात सेव्ह होईल."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:5959/doc/append",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ title: $('Loop Over Titles').item.json.Title, text: ($json.response ? $json.response : $('Build Claude Prompt').item.json.combinedText), color: ($json.response ? 'black' : 'red') }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "22",
      "name": "Append to Word",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -240,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "प्रत्येक task चा निकाल Word फाईलमध्ये जोडून लगेच सेव्ह करतो. Claude चालला असेल तर काळा; Claude bypass असेल तर Gemini+Grok चा मजकूर लाल रंगात."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:5959/doc/finish",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ finish: true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "23",
      "name": "Close Word Doc",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -1200,
        320
      ],
      "notes": "सर्व titles संपल्यावर Word फाईल save करून बंद करतो."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "r1",
              "name": "resultFile",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.docxPath}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "r2",
              "name": "textFile",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.txtPath}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "15",
      "name": "Final Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -960,
        320
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
